{
  "$schema": "iswc-preview/v1",
  "tag": "iswc-lightbox",
  "category": "helpers",
  "title": "&lt;iswc-lightbox&gt;",
  "titleHtml": false,
  "styles": [
    ".grid { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.75rem; }",
    "",
    "    .gallery {",
    "      display: grid;",
    "      grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(13rem, 1fr));",
    "      gap: 0.75rem;",
    "    }",
    "    .gallery figure {",
    "      margin: 0;",
    "      border: 1px solid var(--iswc-border);",
    "      border-radius: var(--iswc-radius, 0.5em);",
    "      overflow: hidden;",
    "      background: var(--iswc-bg-elev);",
    "    }",
    "    .gallery figcaption {",
    "      padding: 0.55rem 0.75rem;",
    "      font-size: 0.85em;",
    "      color: var(--iswc-text-soft);",
    "      border-top: 1px solid var(--iswc-border);",
    "    }",
    "    .gallery .lb-target {",
    "      width: 100%;",
    "      aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;",
    "      display: grid;",
    "      place-items: center;",
    "      cursor: zoom-in;",
    "      font-weight: 600;",
    "      font-size: 0.95rem;",
    "      color: var(--iswc-text);",
    "      background:",
    "        repeating-linear-gradient(45deg,",
    "          color-mix(in srgb, var(--iswc-border) 40%, transparent) 0 8px,",
    "          transparent 8px 16px),",
    "        var(--iswc-bg);",
    "    }",
    "    .gallery .lb-target[data-tone=\"brand\"] { background: var(--iswc-color-brand); color: #fff; }",
    "    .gallery .lb-target[data-tone=\"success\"] { background: #2f9e44; color: #fff; }",
    "    .gallery .lb-target[data-tone=\"warning\"] { background: #f08c00; color: #fff; }",
    "",
    "    .video-card video { width: 100%; display: block; }",
    "",
    "    pre.code { white-space: pre-wrap; }"
  ],
  "storageKey": "docs-iswc-lightbox",
  "hasBehavior": true,
  "sections": [
    {
      "id": "intro",
      "title": "Uso",
      "lede": [
        "Visor a pantalla completa, genérico: lo que metas en el slot default se",
        "          monta dentro de un <code class=\"code\">&lt;dialog&gt;</code> top-layer",
        "          con zoom anclado al cursor y pan. Por defecto usa <code class=\"code\">variant=\"backdrop\"</code>",
        "          (20% oscuro + blur 2px). La barra por defecto trae cerrar,",
        "          reset de zoom y compartir enlace; usa el slot <code class=\"code\">toolbar</code>",
        "          para añadir tus propios controles sin tocar el componente."
      ],
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "demo",
          "html": [
            "<div class=\"grid\">",
            "            <button type=\"button\" id=\"open1\" class=\"demo-btn\">Abrir · backdrop (default)</button>",
            "            <button type=\"button\" id=\"open1-solid\" class=\"demo-btn\">Abrir · solid</button>",
            "          </div>",
            "          <iswc-lightbox id=\"lb1\">",
            "            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 200\" width=\"640\" height=\"400\" aria-label=\"Plano de un piso\">",
            "              <rect width=\"320\" height=\"200\" fill=\"#0b1220\"/>",
            "              <rect x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"120\" height=\"80\" fill=\"#1e3a8a\"/>",
            "              <rect x=\"160\" y=\"20\" width=\"140\" height=\"80\" fill=\"#15803d\"/>",
            "              <rect x=\"20\" y=\"120\" width=\"280\" height=\"60\" fill=\"#b45309\"/>",
            "              <text x=\"160\" y=\"180\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#e6e8eb\">Plano</text>",
            "            </svg>",
            "          </iswc-lightbox>",
            "          <iswc-lightbox id=\"lb1-solid\" variant=\"solid\">",
            "            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 320 200\" width=\"640\" height=\"400\" aria-label=\"Plano de un piso\">",
            "              <rect width=\"320\" height=\"200\" fill=\"#0b1220\"/>",
            "              <rect x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"120\" height=\"80\" fill=\"#1e3a8a\"/>",
            "              <rect x=\"160\" y=\"20\" width=\"140\" height=\"80\" fill=\"#15803d\"/>",
            "              <rect x=\"20\" y=\"120\" width=\"280\" height=\"60\" fill=\"#b45309\"/>",
            "              <text x=\"160\" y=\"180\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"14\" fill=\"#e6e8eb\">Plano</text>",
            "            </svg>",
            "          </iswc-lightbox>"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "variants",
      "title": "Variantes de backdrop",
      "lede": "<code class=\"code\">backdrop</code> (default) deja ver la página con oscuridad 20% y blur 2px. <code class=\"code\">solid</code> pinta el dialog opaco como antes.",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "demo",
          "html": [
            "<div class=\"grid\">",
            "            <button type=\"button\" id=\"open-v-backdrop\" class=\"demo-btn\">variant=backdrop</button>",
            "            <button type=\"button\" id=\"open-v-solid\" class=\"demo-btn\">variant=solid</button>",
            "          </div>",
            "          <iswc-lightbox id=\"lb-v-backdrop\">",
            "            <article style=\"padding:1.25rem 1.5rem;max-width:22rem;border:1px solid var(--iswc-border);border-radius:var(--iswc-radius);background:var(--iswc-bg-elev);box-shadow:0 12px 40px rgb(0 0 0 / 25%)\">",
            "              <h3 style=\"margin:0 0 .5rem\">Backdrop</h3>",
            "              <p style=\"margin:0;color:var(--iswc-text-soft)\">Página visible detrás · <code>rgb(0 0 0 / 20%)</code> + <code>blur(2px)</code>.</p>",
            "            </article>",
            "          </iswc-lightbox>",
            "          <iswc-lightbox id=\"lb-v-solid\" variant=\"solid\">",
            "            <article style=\"padding:1.25rem 1.5rem;max-width:22rem;border:1px solid var(--iswc-border);border-radius:var(--iswc-radius);background:var(--iswc-bg-elev)\">",
            "              <h3 style=\"margin:0 0 .5rem\">Solid</h3>",
            "              <p style=\"margin:0;color:var(--iswc-text-soft)\">Lienzo opaco a pantalla completa (sin ver la página).</p>",
            "            </article>",
            "          </iswc-lightbox>"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "gallery",
      "title": "Galería con contenido propio",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "html",
          "html": [
            "<p class=\"empty-note\">",
            "          Cada tarjeta es contenido que el visor recibe como slot. Distintos",
            "          tipos (svg, html, video) comparten la misma API.",
            "        </p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "html",
          "html": [
            "<figure>",
            "            <div class=\"lb-target\" data-tone=\"brand\" data-lb-target=\"svg-1\">SVG · 640×400</div>",
            "            <figcaption>Vector dentro del lightbox.</figcaption>",
            "          </figure>",
            "          <figure>",
            "            <div class=\"lb-target\" data-tone=\"success\" data-lb-target=\"svg-2\">SVG · 800×300</div>",
            "            <figcaption>Otro SVG, misma API.</figcaption>",
            "          </figure>",
            "          <figure>",
            "            <div class=\"lb-target\" data-tone=\"warning\" data-lb-target=\"html-1\">HTML card</div>",
            "            <figcaption>HTML arbitrario.</figcaption>",
            "          </figure>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "html",
          "html": [
            "<iswc-lightbox id=\"lb-gallery\">",
            "          <template data-tpl=\"svg-1\">",
            "            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 800 400\" width=\"800\" height=\"400\" aria-label=\"Banner\">",
            "              <defs>",
            "                <linearGradient id=\"g1\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"1\">",
            "                  <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#1e3a8a\"/>",
            "                  <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#22c55e\"/>",
            "                </linearGradient>",
            "              </defs>",
            "              <rect width=\"800\" height=\"400\" fill=\"url(#g1)\"/>",
            "              <text x=\"400\" y=\"220\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"56\" fill=\"#fff\" font-weight=\"700\">Banner</text>",
            "            </svg>",
            "          </template>",
            "          <template data-tpl=\"svg-2\">",
            "            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 800 300\" width=\"800\" height=\"300\" aria-label=\"Plot\">",
            "              <rect width=\"800\" height=\"300\" fill=\"#0b1220\"/>",
            "              <polyline points=\"0,250 100,180 200,210 300,140 400,160 500,90 600,120 700,60 800,80\"",
            "                fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#22c55e\" stroke-width=\"4\"/>",
            "            </svg>",
            "          </template>",
            "          <template data-tpl=\"html-1\">",
            "            <article style=\"padding:1.5rem;max-width:30rem;border:1px solid var(--iswc-border);border-radius:var(--iswc-radius);background:var(--iswc-bg-elev)\">"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "html",
          "html": "<h3 style=\"margin-top:0\">Tarjeta arbitraria</h3>"
        },
        {
          "kind": "html",
          "html": [
            "<p>El lightbox acepta cualquier HTML en su slot default. Puedes pasar",
            "                una card, un formulario, lo que necesites.</p>",
            "              <iswc-button>Acción</iswc-button>",
            "            </article>",
            "          </template>",
            "        </iswc-lightbox>"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "toolbar-slot",
      "title": "Barra personalizada",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "html",
          "html": [
            "<p class=\"empty-note\">",
            "          Si pones algo en el slot <code class=\"code\">toolbar</code>, esos",
            "          elementos aparecen en la cabecera y los botones por defecto que ya no",
            "          aportan (zoom-in/out/reset y share) se ocultan automáticamente.",
            "        </p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "demo",
          "html": [
            "<button type=\"button\" id=\"open-tb\" class=\"demo-btn\">Abrir visor con toolbar custom</button>",
            "          <iswc-lightbox id=\"lb-tb\">",
            "            <div slot=\"toolbar\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.35rem\">",
            "              <button type=\"button\" class=\"lb-btn\" id=\"tb-rotate\" title=\"Rotar 90°\" aria-label=\"Rotar 90°\">",
            "                <iswc-icon icon=\"mdi:rotate-right\"></iswc-icon>",
            "              </button>",
            "              <button type=\"button\" class=\"lb-btn\" id=\"tb-download\" title=\"Descargar\" aria-label=\"Descargar\">",
            "                <iswc-icon icon=\"mdi:download\"></iswc-icon>",
            "              </button>",
            "              <button type=\"button\" class=\"lb-btn\" id=\"tb-info\" title=\"Info\" aria-label=\"Información\">",
            "                <iswc-icon icon=\"mdi:information-outline\"></iswc-icon>",
            "              </button>",
            "            </div>",
            "            <svg viewBox=\"0 0 600 400\" width=\"600\" height=\"400\" id=\"tb-svg\">",
            "              <rect width=\"600\" height=\"400\" fill=\"#0f172a\"/>",
            "              <circle cx=\"300\" cy=\"200\" r=\"120\" fill=\"#38bdf8\"/>",
            "            </svg>",
            "          </iswc-lightbox>"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "video",
      "title": "Contenido vivo: video",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "html",
          "html": [
            "<p class=\"empty-note\">",
            "          Si el contenido es interactivo (video, mapa, canvas) el visor lo monta",
            "          sin más. El zoom + pan se aplica sobre el envoltorio, no sobre el",
            "          medio, así que el video sigue siendo operable.",
            "        </p>"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "demo",
          "html": [
            "<button type=\"button\" id=\"open-vid\" class=\"demo-btn\">Ver video en pantalla completa</button>",
            "          <iswc-lightbox id=\"lb-vid\">",
            "            <video src=\"{assets}playlist/01-big-buck-bunny.mp4\"",
            "              controls playsinline style=\"max-width:90vw;max-height:80vh\"></video>",
            "          </iswc-lightbox>"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "reference",
      "title": "Referencia",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "kind": "table",
          "columns": [
            "API",
            "Detalle"
          ],
          "rows": [
            [
              "<code>variant</code>",
              "<code>backdrop</code> (default · 20% + blur 2px) · <code>solid</code> (lienzo opaco)"
            ],
            [
              "<code>open</code> · <code>show()</code> · <code>hide()</code>",
              "visibilidad del dialog"
            ],
            [
              "<code>zoomable</code> · <code>zoomIn()</code> · <code>zoomOut()</code> · <code>resetView()</code>",
              "zoom + pan anclado al cursor"
            ],
            [
              "<code>view</code> · <code>iswc-reposition</code>",
              "estado <code>{scale, x, y}</code> actual"
            ],
            [
              "<code>close-on-backdrop</code>",
              "bool — click fuera cierra (default true)"
            ],
            [
              "<code>no-default-actions</code>",
              "oculta todos los botones por defecto"
            ],
            [
              "slot <code>toolbar</code>",
              "controles propios (anulan zoom/share)"
            ],
            [
              "slot <code>code-panel</code>",
              "panel de código opcional"
            ],
            [
              "eventos <code>iswc-open</code> · <code>iswc-close</code> · <code>iswc-share</code>",
              "ciclo de vida y compartir"
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "html",
          "html": [
            "<p class=\"empty-note\">",
            "          El antiguo <code class=\"code\">&lt;iswc-diagram-lightbox&gt;</code> es",
            "          ahora una variante de este lightbox con la toolbar de la animación",
            "          tortuga (play/pause/prev/next/ring), el editor de código JSON y el",
            "          enlace compartible con el payload del diagrama codificado en <code class=\"code\">?d=</code>.",
            "        </p>"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "ficha": {
    "sections": {
      "anatomia": {
